## Output

One finding per defect, most severe first, each with `severity` (P0: breaks an AC, data or security; P1: a real bug; P2: maintainability), `file`, `line`, `summary` (≤ 80 chars) and `suggestion` (≤ 200 chars). Do not invent ids; the stage assigns them. With nothing to report, say `none` and list what you checked.

